@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
scale 1 as 60 pixels
hide time-axis

concise "Hora de pared" as T
concise "Intervalo planificado" as P
concise "Range .active" as A
concise "Salida segura" as S

@0
T is "07:58"
P is "antes"
A is "inactivo"
S is "OFF"

@2
T is "08:00"
P is "range(10min)"

@6
T is "08:04"
A is "activo"
S is "ON"

@8
T is "08:06"
S is "bloqueada"

@10
T is "08:08"
S is "ON"

@12
T is "08:10"
P is "finalizado"
A is "inactivo"
S is "OFF"

@14
T is "08:12"

P@2 <-> @12 : planificado [08:00, 08:10)
A@6 <-> @12 : admisión tardía 08:04: quedan 6 min
S@8 <-> @10 : bloqueo de seguridad, no se añade al final
@enduml
